        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741160/extras/6586e656a8fa9ca5e58f66d31c0e0a61.avif?t=1784133968\" width=588 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run, jump, and throw strange stuff into your friends' faces!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the whole world as your playground and discover in a new way why &quot;Tag&quot; excited you so much as a child.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741160/extras/895b28ff18134cd54507f346052c7474.poster.avif?t=1784133968\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741160/extras/895b28ff18134cd54507f346052c7474.webm?t=1784133968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741160/extras/895b28ff18134cd54507f346052c7474.mp4?t=1784133968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Catch Me!</i> is a competitive online platformer for 4 players and the most action loaded game of tag you have ever played with your friends. Use interactables to change the world. Close windows to stop your chasers, open up a new escape route or simply stun pursuers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741160/extras/cd9ab22392762da9a53c442e87a0daa9.avif?t=1784133968\" width=588 height=110 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player at a time has the goal to earn points by reaching certain locations on the map without being caught.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The other players are the chasers and try to catch the runner. If they do they become the runner. Simple but fun and as fast as it can be. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump through windows, climb onto house roofs or Ferris wheels or even surf on a subway. Each level plays like a racetrack in a racing game – absolutely unique!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741160/extras/0b8e22e13c388326e036eaa19752286a.poster.avif?t=1784133968\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741160/extras/0b8e22e13c388326e036eaa19752286a.webm?t=1784133968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741160/extras/0b8e22e13c388326e036eaa19752286a.mp4?t=1784133968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against others online to see who has the best scores at the end. Design your very own runner with the help of skins, emojis or animations and show that you are the fastest and best &quot;tag player&quot; in the world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741160/extras/7f38dc22e14173d2480751753634a0ec.avif?t=1784133968\" width=588 height=110 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Online fun for <strong>4 Players</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 Maps</strong> inspired by cities around the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Many chaotic <strong>Interactables</strong>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A big selection of <strong>Character Skins</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The funkiest soundtrack </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Easy to learn, hard to master</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741160/extras/68ddd8cce602396697498e924b7e4811.poster.avif?t=1784133968\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741160/extras/68ddd8cce602396697498e924b7e4811.webm?t=1784133968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741160/extras/68ddd8cce602396697498e924b7e4811.mp4?t=1784133968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741160/extras/6586e656a8fa9ca5e58f66d31c0e0a61.avif?t=1784133968\" width=588 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run, jump, and throw strange stuff into your friends' faces!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the whole world as your playground and discover in a new way why &quot;Tag&quot; excited you so much as a child.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741160/extras/895b28ff18134cd54507f346052c7474.poster.avif?t=1784133968\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741160/extras/895b28ff18134cd54507f346052c7474.webm?t=1784133968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741160/extras/895b28ff18134cd54507f346052c7474.mp4?t=1784133968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Catch Me!</i> is a competitive online platformer for 4 players and the most action loaded game of tag you have ever played with your friends. Use interactables to change the world. Close windows to stop your chasers, open up a new escape route or simply stun pursuers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741160/extras/cd9ab22392762da9a53c442e87a0daa9.avif?t=1784133968\" width=588 height=110 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player at a time has the goal to earn points by reaching certain locations on the map without being caught.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The other players are the chasers and try to catch the runner. If they do they become the runner. Simple but fun and as fast as it can be. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump through windows, climb onto house roofs or Ferris wheels or even surf on a subway. Each level plays like a racetrack in a racing game – absolutely unique!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741160/extras/0b8e22e13c388326e036eaa19752286a.poster.avif?t=1784133968\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741160/extras/0b8e22e13c388326e036eaa19752286a.webm?t=1784133968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741160/extras/0b8e22e13c388326e036eaa19752286a.mp4?t=1784133968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against others online to see who has the best scores at the end. Design your very own runner with the help of skins, emojis or animations and show that you are the fastest and best &quot;tag player&quot; in the world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741160/extras/7f38dc22e14173d2480751753634a0ec.avif?t=1784133968\" width=588 height=110 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Online fun for <strong>4 Players</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 Maps</strong> inspired by cities around the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Many chaotic <strong>Interactables</strong>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A big selection of <strong>Character Skins</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The funkiest soundtrack </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Easy to learn, hard to master</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741160/extras/68ddd8cce602396697498e924b7e4811.poster.avif?t=1784133968\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741160/extras/68ddd8cce602396697498e924b7e4811.webm?t=1784133968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741160/extras/68ddd8cce602396697498e924b7e4811.mp4?t=1784133968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "short_description": "Compete online against your friends and other players in this chaotic and fast paced 4-player game of tag! Race across different locations, jump through windows, electrocute the other players, or throw cats at them. (No cats were harmed in the production of this game.)",
